('APX-C-4108', '4108', 'Main Character', 'Main Character: @IMG Calm, controlled presence. Subtle confident smile. Face identity must remain perfectly consistent across all frames.', 15, '1:1', 'https://x.com/doctorwasif/status/2050906512957276640', 'Style: Ultra-realistic mass celebrity arrival scene. Single continuous shot. Handheld camera from crowd perspective. Natural micro-shake. No cuts. Documentary-level realism.
