('APX-S-4024-1', 'APX-C-4024', 1, 0, 5, 5, null, 519, 233, 'The camera starts behind the snowboarder at the top of a snowy peak. The rider drops in aggressively downhill. Powder snow sprays toward the camera, slight lens snow effects, intense speed feeling.', 'driver', null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
