('APX-S-4058-1', 'APX-C-4058', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 254, 'INTENT: Create a playful, high-energy friendship adventure that briefly turns tense when one rider is pulled into storm clouds, then resolves with a triumphant rescue and joyful return.', 'driver', null, null, null, null, 'playful'),
('APX-S-4041-1', 'APX-C-4041', 1, null, null, null, 'Ultra-realistic rooftop airport on top of a ruined megacity, storm clouds below the skyscrapers. Female pilot runs across the landing deck toward the final departing ship. Jetstream armor forms around her body from spinning turbine air.', null, null, 'Jetstream armor forms around her body from spinning turbine air.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, 'rooftop, airport', null),
('APX-S-4041-2', 'APX-C-4041', 2, null, null, null, 'Enemy drones descend from clouds. Camera chases behind her across the runway. She slides under one drone, launches another off the roof edge. Final frame: front of the ship view, ship engines ignite as city lights vanish below clouds.', null, null, 'Camera chases behind her across the runway. She slides under one drone, launches another off the roof edge.', null, 'sliding', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4048-1', 'APX-C-4048', 1, 0, 4, 4, null, 863, 320, 'Elegant slow camera and around the full Erosion Bench in a tranquil minimalist outdoor public plaza with soft morning light.', null, null, null, null, 'plaza', 'calm'),
('APX-S-4048-2', 'APX-C-4048', 2, 4, 9, 5, null, 1196, 324, 'Smooth montage of close-up details gliding across the bench’s surface — layered striations, soft water-carved edges, and ergonomic seating. Gentle animated light reflections and water-like glints evoke millions of years of canyon erosion.', null, null, null, null, 'canyon', 'calm'),
('APX-S-4048-3', 'APX-C-4048', 3, 9, 13, 4, null, 1534, 216, 'Three diverse people (young adult, couple, and older person) comfortably sitting together on the bench in a natural, relaxed way. Show the ergonomic comfort and shared social experience. Camera gently circles them.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-4048-4', 'APX-C-4048', 4, 13, 15, 2, null, 1765, 364, 'Clean final of the bench. Elegant brand text appears: “STRATA FORM” “EROSION BENCH” “www. End on a serene, timeless note with a slow fade. Mood: Tranquil, premium, nature-inspired, enduring, and quietly powerful.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-4044-1', 'APX-C-4044', 1, 0, 3.2, 3.2, null, 260, 452, 'The camera sticks tightly to the toy car’s front, at high speed, simulating a real racing. Speed increases rapidly, fully igniting the child’s imagination.', null, 'racing', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4044-2', 'APX-C-4044', 2, 3.2, 4.8, 1.6, null, 731, 316, 'The toy car races straight into the dark shadow under the sofa. Light suddenly disappears, carpet textures stretch into radial, the entire frame is swallowed by darkness.', null, 'leaping; racing', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4044-3', 'APX-C-4044', 3, 4.8, 8, 3.2, null, 1066, 504, 'The camera maintains the exact same low ground-level high-speed shot as the previous scene, making it feel like the same car instantly scales from toy size to a real racing car.', null, 'racing', null, null, null, 'intense'),
